{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794559159500,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf0faceffe252ikv7TdsZfO1","part":{"partID":"prt_1d40fa8c1001uWltufzDWcHVtQ","sessionID":"ses_e2bf0faceffe252ikv7TdsZfO1","messageID":"msg_1d40f60e2001RtgqPz5uHPVeQK","type":"tool","id":"call_1e0e6155fc1e44e8af6e179a","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/014-review-remediation/scratch/before.txt"},"output":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/014-review-remediation/scratch/before.txt, lines 1-35\n1: $ git rev-parse --short HEAD\n2: 320e7b64d4\n3: $ FLOOR\n4: {\"correct\":24,\"total\":44}\n5: {\"count\":0,\"total\":35}\n6: {\"own\":24,\"attached\":20,\"combined\":44,\"total\":44}\n7: {\"own\":8,\"attached\":15,\"combined\":23,\"total\":45}\n8: $ EVAL\n9: [160,50,21,5]\n10: $ TC\n11: exit=0\n12: $ VALL\n13:  Test Files  179 passed (179)\n14:       Tests  1712 passed | 8 skipped (1720)\n15: exit=0\n16: $ DALL\n17: ℹ pass 1164\n18: ℹ fail 0\n19: $ VSR\n20: ℹ pass 90\n21: ℹ fail 0\n22: $ SRD --check\n23: STATUS=OK session-reader-declarations: 20 file(s) current\n24: $ DERIVE\n25: fresh\n26: $ RV\n27: exit=0\n28: $ SRM\n29: [runtime-mirror-sync] PASS: 256 mirrors across 10 trees are in sync.\n30: exit=0\n31: $ G2SUM\n32: {\"claude\":\"3 of 6\",\"codex\":\"0 of 6\",\"devin\":\"4 of 6\",\"dsh\":\"3 of 4\",\"opencode\":\"5 of 6\",\"pi\":\"4 of 6\"}\n33: $ HOLD\n34: {\"holdout\":44,\"rows\":44,\"attachedRows\":0,\"typedRows\":0}\n35: order: phase 015 also edits lib/command-attach.ts, scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs, command-routing-baseline.json, run-command-behaviour.mjs, score-command-transcripts.mjs, tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts, feature ARCHITECTURE.md and doctor-setup.yaml. Phase