{"type":"text","timestamp":1794559281653,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf0faceffe252ikv7TdsZfO1","part":{"id":"prt_1d41189d9002Xy1ppmzI6Ajl2q","sessionID":"ses_e2bf0faceffe252ikv7TdsZfO1","messageID":"msg_1d4114160001LsEBvx7uo1hAWt","type":"text","text":"**Task T012 complete.** All edits made to the single file the task names.\n\n## Files written\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts`\n  - Added `NO_EDIT_REQUEST` to the existing `../command-attach.js` import.\n  - Deleted the local `const NO_EDIT_REQUEST` and the comment above it.\n  - Deleted the empty `if` on `\\bsemantic (code )?search\\b` in `primaryIntentBonus`.\n\nNo other tracked file was edited. The advisor `dist` (gitignored) was rebuilt so the capture harness could see the changed source.\n\n## Verify output\n\n```\n$ rg -c \"const NO_EDIT_REQUEST\" $FU      → no output (exit 1)\n$ rg -c \"semantic \\(code\" $FU            → no output (exit 1)\n\n$ TC   (npm run typecheck, in ADV)\n> typecheck\n> ../../system-spec-kit/node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit --composite false -p tsconfig.build.json\nTC exit=0\n\n$ FLOOR\n{\"correct\":24,\"total\":44}\n{\"count\":0,\"total\":35}\n{\"own\":24,\"attached\":20,\"combined\":44,\"total\":44}\n{\"own\":8,\"attached\":15,\"combined\":23,\"total\":45}\n\n$ EVAL\n[160,50,21,5]\n```\n\nFLOOR and EVAL match the four lines and `[160,50,21,5]` recorded in `scratch/before.txt` (lines 4–7 and 9). The scoped `git diff` shows only the three intended changes.\n\n## Notes\n- First FLOOR run refused with `@spec-kit/system-skill-advisor dist is stale (source content differs from the attested build)`; I ran `npm run build` in `ADV` (exit 0, `dist/` is gitignored) and FLOOR then matched `before.txt` exactly.\n- Checkbox in `tasks.md` left unticked, per instruction.\n- Nothing I could not do.","time":{"start":1794559281625,"end":1794559281653}}}
